{"type": "final", "turn": 3, "content": "\n\nYour Studio account has three runnable models (in project **Karst Features in Pennsylvania**, all with completed runs):\n\n| Model | Type | Predicts | Output band (from results) |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| **KarstBinary** (`ac1eb985`) | fine-tuned | Per-pixel regression value, not a class or confidence | `sample_karst_score` |\n| **KarstNumber** (`f67d97d9`) | fine-tuned | Per-pixel regression value | `sample_number` |\n| **KarstEmbedding** (`5aafb53d`) | embeddings | No declared prediction type \u2014 feature/embeddings output rather than a per-pixel value | n/a |\n\nSo the two fine-tuned models each produce a continuous score per pixel over their AOI (runnable via `olmoearth_submit_prediction` with a model_id, area, and date range); the embeddings model doesn't emit a plain per-pixel map.\n\nOne caveat: this list covers only your Studio account. Ai2 also publishes additional fine-tuned OlmoEarth models (task cards) outside this account, so it isn't the complete universe of models you could run \u2014 tell me if you'd like help running one of these over an area.", "forced_by_turn_cap": false, "seq": 8, "t": 69.69, "seconds": 8.583}
